<title>USA: HA-LO to acquire Bradley Marketing Group.</title>
<headline>HA-LO to acquire Bradley Marketing Group.</headline>
<dateline>NILES, Ill. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>HA-LO Industries Inc said Thursday it agreed to acquire  Bradley Marketing Group, a Detroit-based promotional product company with 1996 revenues of $9.7 million.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>HA-LO distributes specialty and premium advertising products.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
